From 7255fec8b3a8321ed99ca5b40b602b1a9e546de3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Feb 2026 11:16:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1994/5749] test(git-worktree): fix test pollution from
 incomplete fs mock

Replace mock.module with spyOn + mockRestore to prevent fs module
pollution across test files. mock.module replaces the entire module
and caused 69 test failures in other files that depend on fs.
---
 .../collect-git-diff-stats.test.ts            | 90 +++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 45 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

